flowchart TB
    teamSignals[Member-Team escalation,\nblocked/cost signals, or membership change]
    operator[Operator or policy input]
    fingerprint[Deduplicate runtime signal fingerprints]
    agenda[Pending governance agenda item]
    group[Governance group\nmember Team boundary]
    lease[Lease the governance manager]
    decide{Decision}
    directive[Durable operator directive]
    teamManager[Target member Team's manager inbox]
    teamWork[Normal Team routing and work]
    handled[Mark governance agenda handled]

    teamSignals --> fingerprint --> agenda
    operator --> agenda
    group --> agenda
    agenda --> lease --> decide
    decide -- route action --> directive --> teamManager --> teamWork --> handled
    decide -- no directive required --> handled

    ownership[Group membership authorizes visibility and the Team target.\nA governance directive can target only that member Team's manager;\nit does not assign tasks or decide reviews.]
    ownership --- group
    ownership --- directive
